{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49885","headline":"木兰花 二 · 许岷","name":"木兰花 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南日暖芭蕉展，美人折得亲裁翦。\n画成小简寄情人，临行更把轻轻捻。\n其中捻破相思字，却恐郎疑踪不似。\n若还猜妾倩人书，误了平生多少事。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许岷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}